-- Six townsfolk across two cities, some of them merchants. @ is the locative: where the selection stands, not what it is.
-- Merchant @ Whiterun and Merchant & Whiterun are the same mask: both lower to merchant ∧ Whiterun. @ only becomes a different machine as fold scope (+/ Gold @ Nord), a lattice shape (pred @ 8 8), or an anchored frame (Oil @ blast(5) at p). Whiterun ships as a bind mask (region = :Whiterun; the .reg format has no derived column). Row 2 is inside Whiterun but no merchant; rows 1, 5 are merchants but in Riften.
--! registry ../registries/004-scoped-selection.reg
--! expect gold = 5100 100 100 5100 100 100

Merchant @ Whiterun , Gold += 5000
